# wmbus-toolkit configuration
#
# Copy to meters.conf and fill in your own data. meters.conf is ignored by
# git, so real meter data never ends up in the repository.
#
# Format: one line per meter, fields comma-separated, key=value.
# Blank lines and # are ignored.
#
# Required:  id     - meter id as shown by wmbusmeters (8 digits)
# Optional:  name   - free name for the output
#            serial - printed serial number from the label
#            model  - model/type number from the label
#            key    - if already known, 32 hex chars
#
# serial, model and key help the candidate generator. If absent, only
# id-based and generic candidates are built.

# Examples with mock data (commented out - replace with your own lines):

# id=12345678, name=MeterA, serial=1234567890
# id=23456789, name=MeterB, serial=2345678901, model=ABC1234
# id=34567890, name=MeterC, model=XYZ5678, key=0123456789ABCDEF0123456789ABCDEF
